P2A-DEV-LP02:
NUMBER n.
INPUT(n).
NUMBER total = 0.
LOOP (NUMBER i = 1 TILL i <= n, i++) {
 IF (i % 2 != 0) { total += 1. }
}
DISPLAYNL(total).

